4:["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-slate prose-lg max-w-none prose-headings:font-bold prose-headings:tracking-tight prose-h2:text-2xl prose-h2:mt-12 prose-h2:mb-4 prose-h3:text-xl prose-h3:mt-8 prose-h3:mb-3 prose-p:leading-relaxed prose-p:text-slate-600 prose-li:text-slate-600 prose-a:text-indigo-600 prose-a:no-underline hover:prose-a:underline prose-strong:text-slate-900","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"Bingo is one of the most reliable party games ever invented. It works for groups of 5 or 50, requires almost no explanation, and creates genuine excitement. But there's a difference between a good bingo game and a great one. Here's how to make yours unforgettable."}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Before the Party: Setup"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Choose Your Bingo Style"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"There are two main approaches to party bingo:"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Caller Bingo"}]," — Someone reads items aloud, guests mark matches. Fast-paced and exciting, best for dedicated game time."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Event Bingo"}]," — Squares describe things that might happen at the party. Guests mark squares throughout the event as moments happen organically. Low-maintenance and runs in the background."]}]]}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Create Your Cards"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Use ",["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/create","children":"MyBingoCard's free generator"}]," to create custom cards. A few key tips:"]}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"Use 30-40 unique items even though only 24 fit per card — this ensures variety"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Mix easy and hard items for balanced gameplay"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Include inside jokes that your specific group will appreciate"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Print 20% more cards than your guest count"}]]}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Prepare Prizes"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Prizes are what separate \"meh\" bingo from \"legendary\" bingo. You don't need expensive prizes — creativity wins:"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Gift cards"}]," — Even $5-10 creates real competition"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Candy/treats"}]," — A bag of good chocolate never disappoints"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Fun trophies"}]," — Dollar store crowns, silly hats, or toy medals"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Privileges"}]," — First pick of dessert, DJ song request, exempt from cleanup"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Mystery bags"}]," — Wrapped random items create excitement and laughs"]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"During the Game: Execution"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"The Rules Announcement (Keep It Short)"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Spend no more than 30 seconds explaining rules. Most people know bingo, so keep it brief: \"Mark squares when you see or hear the item. Complete a line in any direction — horizontal, vertical, or diagonal — and yell BINGO! First confirmed bingo wins the prize. Let's play!\""}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"The Caller (If Using One)"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The caller sets the energy. Tips for great calling:"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"Speak clearly and loudly — repeat each item twice"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Pause 10-15 seconds between calls to let people scan"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Build tension: \"The next item is... (pause)... CAKE TIME!\""}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Comment on the game: \"That's a rare one — who has it?\""}]]}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Verification"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"When someone yells BINGO, verify their card. Read back their marked items to confirm they're all valid. If it's a false alarm, play continues. This takes 30 seconds and prevents disputes."}],"$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18"]}]
